@WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001
@token = secret123

### Health
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/health

### Preset (VRChat)
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/preset/1?k={{token}}

### Submit code-review for VR ticket
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/code/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "class Student { public string Name; }",
  "language": "csharp",
  "ticketCode": "7K3MP"
}

### Inbox (VRChat)
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/inbox?room=metalab&k={{token}}

### Ask (legacy)
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/ask?k={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "int x = 0;",
  "language": "csharp"
}
